{"nodes": [{"id": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_decision", "label": "ADR 0197: Give every song a sound profile: loudness, busyness, timbre and loudness over time", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Playlists must sound alike and follow an energy; the fingerprint finds only the same recording and BPM and key say nothing of sound. Rejected: a separate SOUND_VERSION (one version keeps one meaning of analysed, ADR 0109); deriving from stored details or the thumbnail (not every song has details; 192 columns too few); a learned embedding (tens of MB, no Rust port; possible later); an absolute energy from LUFS (a one-genre collection would sit at one energy)."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_timbre", "label": "Timbre (20 numbers)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "16 bands from 40 Hz to 16 kHz each against the frame's mean band (the shape whatever the volume), the spectral centroid, flatness and the share of power under 150 Hz and over 5 kHz; likeness is the cosine of z-scored timbres."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_lufs", "label": "Integrated loudness (lufs)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "BS.1770-style loudness: K-weighting approximated in the spectrum, 400 ms blocks, gated at -70 LUFS and 10 LU under the first mean."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_curve", "label": "Loudness curve", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The loudness about every 2 s in quarter-dB steps from -60 LUFS, as base64 bytes; the set builder can read intros, drops and outros from it."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_onsets", "label": "Onsets", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Onsets per second: peaks of the band flux above its mean plus half a deviation, at least 2 frames apart."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_energy", "label": "Energy relative to the collection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rank in loudness (0.45), onsets (0.3), highs (0.15) and BPM (0.1, half-time doubled), ranked again into 1-10; Mixed In Key's Energy N in a comment or grouping wins."}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0147_glue_home_analyses_natively_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0109_one_meaning_of_not_analysed_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0197-a-sound-profile-for-every-song.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_decision", "target": "src_core_audio_sound", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/ad